  "delta": [
    "D7 freezes the named watchdog config fields, unit lifecycle, once-per-unit evaluation, the full watchdog.flagged data payload and the mobile host-signal boundary. The upstream watchdog.json stays byte-identical; these cases live in the phone overlay.",
    "Config defaults are exercised as values, not prose: an absent member takes the schema default; zero disables the corresponding check; negative, wrong-type and unknown members are rejected with the codes in watchdog.md §2.",
    "The monitor scenarios drive the real BotWatchdogMonitor: start/finish idempotency, tick cadence, all five base checks, the three mobile descriptors and the once-per-unit set."
  ],
